        "id": 1463964
      },
      "writtenOn": "2020-02-04T17:14:56Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "That makes sense - thanks for considering this.\n\nI agree that requiring the caller to set the fields appropriately is the most straightforward answer here. Marking resolved.",
      "parentUuid": "6f2e1c85_24aeaf9d",
      "revId": "d87c62ca3f6c497ac288dd6ca6d5ca5ab3cf6dd8",
      "serverId": "85c56323-6fa9-3386-8a01-6480fb634889",
      "unresolved": false
